  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac95d1bb3a1910b8075093dd",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呵，我开始热血沸腾了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "27203c977f7f48a42e5ae7684089445f0f566b4b8da6c8e978351c183a93284f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "95007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1016/95007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8547d23ef69bb4676134e44a",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看我彻底突破极限……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7728540d9db13bf2620be37c88ca939a5ea504f9e7c72bb3bac67b631c085d7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "95008"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1016/95008"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bf4a3e87725337f8105fd6f",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "磨利尖牙及利爪──\r\n将对方的咽喉，紧咬不放！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d43ffcf9f17f826f82794837133cfcd1e403d1f6cfc9cfd4127aa49bb3cbc92e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "95009"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1016/95009"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb1879c76e96bc744c56b224",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我是成田白仁。做好觉悟了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9ab463627ba63a4d414e957d01c5b7f53a10c31c3a314ae944c6826a8546fb1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "95010"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1016/95010"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94c928c2add529b183e9df96",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们团结一致地去完成吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "978b5bb93c2a978f8835c9b34e3e1982c43215d7fbe5693e8c9129031bd0ebf4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "1000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1017/1000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:326369f8e41c92f956652a14",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你已有觉悟和我一起\r\n朝共同志向迈进，\r\n我就得拿出不辜负于你的成果呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d65eb7cd750d9e7d96803e6e9cc56a46d0cab409fe2e7ea0f3c247c3ff3f8517",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1017/10000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcab14c05d11d53e4272e73a",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "行ってくる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c258c6fbb37905535703e68e2fc288861a7a636980f7eab0cb36dd332608f75",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "100000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1017/100000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:867ac07ae7b664df13f211a2",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "ただいま戻った。",
      "source_fingerprint": "809c344db5c628d87546acdce913a8c26b391e0d2fbb431c8b0b8ab477a20ac2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "100001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1017/100001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:079d71040dde142f4a696fb0",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一直被我视为妄想的「顶点」──\r\n因为有你的陪伴与协助，\r\n才让我感觉正在一步步接近它。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfeb668c927def35da5845ef4f0ce4f4410911f363d06f397ebf4462269913d8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1017/10001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:893164c5da842c0c88aab1a0",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "站在别人的立场去思考，\r\n就能发现到原本没发现的观点……\r\n这是你教会我的哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "713fc291d5729da96dc3db7acd523209cdb1fb539e9fe141c24da3815a5d452b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10002"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1017/10002"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0a805b337caa00a9719cb19",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新年快乐。\r\n今年我们也要同心协力一起努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "adf4cb8c8d0c913ea0a6256442de3460784394f57f6a143a93d2c531d5812b3d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10003"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1017/10003"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ec311d3334df5bc4e3bea30",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有学生把巧克力送来学生会办公室。\r\n感恩戴德──我会用心做好我在\r\n学生会的职务，来报答这份恩情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df73f3569ceadfb63f9d27e4b104e605d3665c7403831c2ecbaf3d619c356c09",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10004"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1017/10004"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8822b93c495ddc97f0a4445",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我做了巧克力，你收下吧。\r\n里面只加一点点糖，是为了表达\r\n我们挑战的道路上不会只有甜头。",
      "source_fingerprint": "870fea8d8e5b5dd45c42dbcdd07dbee54a890d99207ea458d197ac792f99aab2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1017/10005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eddf7260d15370200b1e33b3",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "把对学生会的意见写在签纸上的\r\n七夕活动似乎颇受好评。\r\n我会尽力实现大家的愿望的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92440d769d78eb0220ba544e43b01e4aa100cb7b27a3328796ecb0297c4b3984",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10006"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1017/10006"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b45d0d3f6fb6ac62dbe51c8f",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "万圣节快乐。到处都听到\r\n有学生在感叹吃了太多点心，\r\n希望你不会这样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ac21dceaaae99adf7e972dca94f1e46af71b18afe25a56562765a08b4391808",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1017/10007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f8555b6d83e6c5001085f45",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "圣诞快乐，训练员君。\r\n虽然今天还要忙学生会主办的活动，\r\n但也要尽情享受节日的气氛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "74c4215baf4712bd9b146ff9287069356bcab93218ee5cf87bca369f3c6fc360",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10008"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1017/10008"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6693399d1b0d3497548e4ae",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "中庭的树好像没有后辈去装饰……\r\n怎么样？跟我一起去巡视兼散步如何？",
      "source_fingerprint": "95e7cc22f585035bcc7a5eb05e91daa1f341f13fafc36a3ceb732ae52b4f6d19",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10009"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1017/10009"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76277e04c96ab603efc98ae1",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "各位都做得很好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb54f2263d66aaf1c538c367a247dd0fd9cb1072adbf6a3ddfd309f35fd9f5e5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "1001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1017/1001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef28aa5324789502ea730655",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一转眼就过完了这充实的一年。\r\n明年我们也要一起进步成长。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d0daa1c8deb86139059916474047f4ee571a8d54af6eb65d1f21d919b5876fb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10010"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1017/10010"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba7bb66729a69bfe6297e819",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天是你的生日吧。\r\n训练结束后来办个小小的庆生会吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a663e3648ea9ff37cd37b3ebc6ef419e631f41c62932f9488b4259cc50b1e0b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10011"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1017/10011"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c576fb20ecff063520d64343",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "生日快乐，训练员君。\r\n身为拥有共同志向的同伴，\r\n我要比谁都更积极庆祝你的生日。",
      "source_fingerprint": "86a33b1ac84e7618d0be2e63fbcca454a4e4a0eee6733792974f9044f44653a0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10012"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1017/10012"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1843cc72a0c2af068865d00b",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不只是收到学生和学生会伙伴，\r\n还能收到你的祝福……\r\n真是大喜过望。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83da3a72414153a3a52055471210b4603fc49893f1f935389494f3397cec0ef9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10013"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1017/10013"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46378a3054b0f506776b1938",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你是特地亲自前来祝我\r\n生日快乐的吗……\r\n庆祝……亲祝……呵呵呵呵……",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfb235c3eae6724adc7329453ec6f1404d0be19adfc9c5860319fa47ca7a6117",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10014"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1017/10014"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15bb422f22a6c7bfdafb46cf",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "收到新公告了。\r\n说不定是什么重要的事情，\r\n确认一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe3ef08fd4af001c45dda89147d7bac01cc5bae48695c0c33c579e987c72cd1c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10015"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1017/10015"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13c5a216a4e9f2fea871ffaf",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "收到礼物了。\r\n呵呵，我也很期待看看是什么东西。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9793d11e98734cf3e84d798ef5c2dd4e524c83173d7bf167540043280d5e76e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10016"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1017/10016"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20256957008b5e65e9dc14a7",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "任务达成了。\r\n如同身经百战这句话，\r\n丰富的经验是会使人成长的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5decf5f34cc8182bc22854a02fd5edc1ae85b35b04debbf0902b91af38a8233",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10017"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1017/10017"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70ba841e8cbb7cca6e4fef72",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好像快要有活动了。\r\n做好万全的准备再去挑战吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d654842e16ac15fd41fd908ee66ddc106aca708cd54c66152b644dda9616c319",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10018"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1017/10018"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:799d22a66267d4bddccd4735",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "活动开始了，\r\n我们一起朝目标勇往直前吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f319d6de5d7c3f2b054441c6ddd3a46b1c812c5c5e7743725d4cf1b27f54e08f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10019"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1017/10019"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b94b73e610b9cf5e60401703",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "反败为胜，下次还有机会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "34dafe736bf4c16861abb62bcde816c70b4ce25e8bc0dcf584ffacd834d0ed94",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "1002"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1017/1002"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e1bffe1845189be0a5077f0",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哦，名册的等级提升了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1da24f83cd748d9a2ad301118e91db889651dd462054da7e448b2792e7a8cc4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "10021"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1017/10021"
